From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ken Russell <kbr@chromium.org>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 18:12:42 -0700
Subject: gpu: revise size checks for compressed texture workarounds.

For the previous upload_oversized_mip_levels_via_unpack_buffer
workaround, compute compressed texture sizes in blocks rather than
pixels to be more correct. Add a regression test for oversized ASTC
mipmap uploads which ensures they don't crash.

Bug: 556435507
